# YieldCurve: Nelson-Siegel and Svensson term-structure fits. The fit has one row
# per observation date and the columns beta_0, beta_1, beta_2 and lambda; an xts
# input keeps its time index, anything else comes back as a matrix.
Nelson.Siegel : @pure fn(rate: xts, maturity: double[]) -> xts
Nelson.Siegel : fn(rate: matrix | double[], maturity: double[]) -> matrix
